><section><section><p><strong><span><span>优秀大学生夏令营通知</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ndCr5iaYPRWlQ0oMxqgyO3mJGLTrWdicoD6Cm2Qjm1fKngsVCkvibbr2ThoJChMVELtTQOU9Eg5QZYzpzFeX1ic5jA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>学院定于2025 年 7 月 3—5 日举办全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营。本次夏令</span><span><span>营旨在为各校2025 届优秀本科毕业生提供交流、学习平台，并为有志于从事生物学、生态学、草学、生物与医药等专业研究的学生提供攻读硕博研究生、进行深入学习与研究的机会</span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ndCr5iaYPRWlQ0oMxqgyO3mJGLTrWdicoD12EfiaFdo8X9apAsibn5pcueYeiavNL1ftYfXd0sc0D9bTtwaBk0ROiaYw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ndCr5iaYPRWlQ0oMxqgyO3mJGLTrWdicoDSJsRzMzAzuUZarNrsf6icMzBLia74uF8zpxrvEZY7r9MBUsWcNZUO4xw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>申请资格</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ndCr5iaYPRWlQ0oMxqgyO3mJGLTrWdicoD6Cm2Qjm1fKngsVCkvibbr2ThoJChMVELtTQOU9Eg5QZYzpzFeX1ic5jA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.所在高校具有推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生资格。</span></p><p><span>2.有意向推免至东北师范大学生命科学学院攻读学术型硕士研究生或直博</span><span><span>生的2026年应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p><p><span>3.学习成绩优秀，本科前5 个学期总成绩排名在本专业前20%以内，或在</span><span><span>本科期间具备以下条件之一者：</span></span></p><p><span>（1）获得国家级科研类竞赛二等奖及以上奖励；</span></p><p><span>（2）以第一作者在核心期刊水平以上至少发表一篇学术论文。</span><span><span>能够获得所在学校研究生推荐免试资格者优先。</span></span></p><p><span>4.外语要求：</span></p><p><span>英语水平须达到以下条件之一：①CET-4≥425分；②CET-6≥425分；③IELTS</span><span><span>≥6.0；④TOEFL≥85。</span></span></p><p><span>5.品德良好，身心健康，无任何违纪和剽窃他人学术成果等不良记录。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ndCr5iaYPRWlQ0oMxqgyO3mJGLTrWdicoD12EfiaFdo8X9apAsibn5pcueYeiavNL1ftYfXd0sc0D9bTtwaBk0ROiaYw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ndCr5iaYPRWlQ0oMxqgyO3mJGLTrWdicoDSJsRzMzAzuUZarNrsf6icMzBLia74uF8zpxrvEZY7r9MBUsWcNZUO4xw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ndCr5iaYPRWlQ0oMxqgyO3mJGLTrWdicoD6Cm2Qjm1fKngsVCkvibbr2ThoJChMVELtTQOU9Eg5QZYzpzFeX1ic5jA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.营员专业</span></strong></p><p><span><span>生命科学类及其他相关专业（药学、医学、食品科学、农学、林学等）2025届毕业生，且拟推免我院生物学、生态学和草学硕士研究生或直博生，或生物与医药专业型硕士研究生.</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><strong><span>接收人数</span></strong></p><p><span>计划招生营员约</span><strong><span> 80 </span></strong><span>人。</span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><strong><span>日程安排</span></strong></p><p><span>7 月 3 日  14：00-16：00 报到</span></p><p><span>7 月 3 日  16：00-17：00 开营仪式</span></p><p><span>7 月 4 日  08：30-11：30 学科平台介绍 I</span></p><p><span>7 月 4 日  13：30-16：30学科平台介绍Ⅱ</span></p><p><span><span>7 月 5 日  09：00-11：00</span></span><span><span>实践参观</span></span></p><p><strong><span>报到地点</span></strong><span>：吉林省长春市南关区林业宾馆（人民大街与自由大路交会）。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><strong><span>营员待遇</span></strong></p><p><span>夏令营期间，学院为校外营员提供免费食宿，为校内营员提供免费就餐。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ndCr5iaYPRWlQ0oMxqgyO3mJGLTrWdicoD12EfiaFdo8X9apAsibn5pcueYeiavNL1ftYfXd0sc0D9bTtwaBk0ROiaYw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ndCr5iaYPRWlQ0oMxqgyO3mJGLTrWdicoDSJsRzMzAzuUZarNrsf6icMzBLia74uF8zpxrvEZY7r9MBUsWcNZUO4xw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ndCr5iaYPRWlQ0oMxqgyO3mJGLTrWdicoDSJsRzMzAzuUZarNrsf6icMzBLia74uF8zpxrvEZY7r9MBUsWcNZUO4xw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ndCr5iaYPRWlQ0oMxqgyO3mJGLTrWdicoD6Cm2Qjm1fKngsVCkvibbr2ThoJChMVELtTQOU9Eg5QZYzpzFeX1ic5jA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人自即日起至 2025年6月25日12:00前，考生登录东北师范大学研究生招生服务系统“夏令营（预推免）登录”模块</span><span><span>（网址</span></span><strong><span><span>https://yz.nenu.edu.cn</span></span><span><span>/ybm</span></span></strong><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>完成注册、填报信息和上传材料。入选名单将于2025年6月30日前在东北师范大学生命科学学院</span></span><span><span>网站</span><strong><span>（</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>https://sky.nenu.edu.cn/</span></strong></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span> </span></span><span><span>公布，届时将建立微信临时通知群，以便夏令营期间沟通，请及时关注</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ndCr5iaYPRWlQ0oMxqgyO3mJGLTrWdicoD12EfiaFdo8X9apAsibn5pcueYeiavNL1ftYfXd0sc0D9bTtwaBk0ROiaYw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ndCr5iaYPRWlQ0oMxqgyO3mJGLTrWdicoDSJsRzMzAzuUZarNrsf6icMzBLia74uF8zpxrvEZY7r9MBUsWcNZUO4xw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>其他</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ndCr5iaYPRWlQ0oMxqgyO3mJGLTrWdicoD6Cm2Qjm1fKngsVCkvibbr2ThoJChMVELtTQOU9Eg5QZYzpzFeX1ic5jA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>优秀营员</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>根据营员综合素质和表现，学院将评选表彰“优秀营员”。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>联系人及联系方式</span></strong></p><p><span>刘老师</span></p><p><span>电话：0431-85099590</span></p><p><span>邮件：liudp669@nenu.edu.cn</span></p><p><strong><span>其他</span></strong></p><p><span>本次夏令营活动中研究生招生相关事宜，最终以教育部和东北师范大学当年</span><span><span>最新研究生招生政策为准。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span><span>END</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>—信息宣传中心—</span></span></p><p><span><span>排版/刘晓晓</span></span></p><p><span><span>校对/赵欣悦 刘晓晓</span></span></p><p><span><span>指导老师/孟月</span></span></p><p><span><span>初审/刘晓晓</span></span></p>